      "content": "\"on the cusp\" sounds good. but if one of the technical guys on the board asks me point-blank, \"did this study reach statistical significance?\" i can't just give them a riddle. \n\nhow should i answer that specific question? i want to keep them from digging deeper into the math without sounding like i'm being dishonest about the 0.06.",
